# Unlocking a Myth: Warrior (jeuno 102) under the era module modules/era/lua/globals/equipment/unlocking_a_myth.lua
# (Module:new('unlocking_a_myth', xi.pre(xi.expansion.ABYSSEA)): RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_ABYSSEA 0). The module
# overrides the global xi.equipment.vigilWeaponRequiredWsPoints (by NyzulFloorProgress) and the Vigil weapons'
# onItemEquip, not the quest, so the server's Lua module loader applies it on both sides (platform round P11) and the C#
# quest reads the global through Player.VigilWeaponRequiredWsPoints. Accepted by a GM, the Sturdy Axe at 250 points:
# NyzulFloorProgress 0: 16000 required: 250 <= 3200: 10091; 80: 880 required: 250 <= 704: 10092; 100: 250 required:
# 10088, completed.
module modules/era/lua/globals/equipment/unlocking_a_myth.lua
lists LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10088
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-31.5,5.9,-117.5 job=WAR lvl=75
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_ABYSSEA 0
quest Jeuno.UnlockingAMythWarrior accepted
item SturdyAxe wsp=250
login
trade Zalsuhm SturdyAxe x1              # no Nyzul progress: 16000 required: 10091
finish
charvar NyzulFloorProgress 80           # a GM
trade Zalsuhm SturdyAxe x1              # 880 required: 250 <= 704: 10092
finish
charvar NyzulFloorProgress 100          # a GM
trade Zalsuhm SturdyAxe x1              # 250 required: 10088 (1)
finish                                  # completed; MYTHIC_LEARNED (1); King's Justice
